                                "sense_id": "537fb662-951a-3967-ae70-096d9da54c1e",
                                "text": "[…] Germany had 284,500 active personnel in the armed forces with only 7500 readily deployable forces and 6810 committed to peace support operations; France had 259,050 personnel[…]"
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "b58fab8b-cec0-30c0-bd03-1c6c1b47d231",
